    LLM: 'Game: Doppelkopf. 48-card German game. 4 players. Queens of Clubs identify Re team (secret). Trump: all Queens > all Jacks > all Diamonds. Must follow suit. Total 240 card points. Re needs 121.',
    Player: "You hold â™£Q + â™ Q. You're the ENTIRE Re team alone? Noâ€”the other â™£Q and â™ Q are with two other players. Wait, with a 48-card double deck, there are TWO of each. The four Queens of Clubs are split: whoever holds the other #2 â™£Q copy is your partner. Signal by playing your â™£Q on a trick your partner wins.",
    objective: 'The Re team (holders of Queens of Clubs) aims to score 121+ of 240 card points; Kontra aims to score 120+.',
